# Check out text files with LF everywhere, Windows included.
#
# Lab/guard.json pins the frozen lab files by sha256. A CRLF checkout (e.g. Git
# for Windows with core.autocrlf=true) changes their bytes, and
# tools/proof_guard.py then reports every frozen file as "differs from the
# reviewed version". Shell scripts and Makefiles also break with CRLF, inside
# the dev container too.
* text=auto eol=lf
